# ------------------------------------------------------------- combat
pattern C tempo=132 swing=0
key     D minor
harmony | Dm | Bb | C | A7 |
pizz    | D3- D3- A3- D3- F3- D3- A3- D3- | Bb2- Bb2- F3- Bb2- D3- Bb2- F3- Bb2- | C3- C3- G3- C3- E3- C3- G3- C3- | A2- A2- E3- A2- C#3- A2- G3- A2- |
bass    | D2:4 D2:4 D2:4 D2:4 | Bb1:4 Bb1:4 Bb1:4 Bb1:4 | C2:4 C2:4 C2:4 C2:4 | A1:4 A1:4 A1:4 C#2:4 |
brass   | [*]!:2 .:6 [*]:2 .:2 [*]:4 | % | % | [*]!:2 .:2 [*]:2 .:2 [*]!:8 |
war     | X... x.x. X... x.xx | % | % | X.x. X.x. XxXx XXXX |
snare   | .... X... .... X..o | % | % | ..x. X..x .xX. XXXX |
timp    | D2!:4 .:12 | F2!:4 .:12 | G2!:4 .:12 | A2!:4 .:4 A2- A2- A2!- A2!- |
crash   | X... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |

# C again with the trumpet tune on top
pattern C2 from C
trumpet | D5:6 F5:2 A5:8 | Bb5:6 A5:2 F5:8 | G5:6 E5:2 C5:4 E5:4 | A5:4 G5- F5- E5:4 C#5:4 |

# one bar that bridges exploring into combat
pattern hit tempo=132 swing=0
key     D minor
harmony | A7 |
timp    | A2? A2? A2 A2 A2 A2 A2! A2! A2! A2! A2!! A2!! A2!!--- |
brass   | .:12 [*]!!:4 |
snare   | oooo oooo xxxx XXXX |

# ------------------------------------------------------------- victory
pattern fanfare
harmony | Bb C | D |
trumpet | D5- F5- Bb5:4 C5- E5- G5:4 | D5:4 F#5:4 A5:8 |
brass   | [*]!:8 [*]!:8 | [*]!:16 |
bass    | Bb1:8 C2:8 | D2:16 |
timp    | _ | D2!:4 .:12 |
crash   | _ | X... .... .... .... |

# ------------------------------------------------------------- arrangement
cue explore
play intro
loop A B

cue combat
loop C C2

cue victory
play fanfare
then explore

switch explore -> combat  at bar      via hit  fade 0.5
switch combat  -> explore at pattern  fade 2
switch *       -> victory at beat     fade 0.3
